{"candidate_id": "las-b17-003", "gate": "G-SPRAK", "target": "passage", "vote": 3, "verdict": "flag", "findings": [{"severity": "major", "quote": "Det är svårt att komma runt.", "note": "class 2/6: 'komma runt' in the abstract sense 'get around (an objection)' mirrors English; the settled Swedish idiom for conceding an unavoidable point is 'komma ifrån'. Native alternative: 'Det är svårt att komma ifrån.'"}, {"severity": "minor", "quote": "Häftena samlades inte.", "note": "class 6: the collector sense in Swedish takes the particle -- 'ingen samlade pa haftena'. Bare 'samlades inte' first reads as 'were not gathered/assembled', which is not the intended sense. Native alternative: 'Ingen samlade pa dem.'"}, {"severity": "minor", "quote": "Där dominerade beskeden redan i de tidigaste årgångarna, och andelen frågor förblir liten hela vägen.", "note": "class 6: tense lurch inside one sentence (preterite 'dominerade' + present 'forblir') that an editor would level out to one tense. Native alternative: '... och andelen fragor forblev liten hela vagen.'"}], "executed_by": "claude-opus-5/G-SPRAK-3"}
